 "text": "Deland Farmer's Coop Grain\nHome\nPictures & Projects\nMore\nHome\nPictures & Projects\nHome\nPictures & Projects\nWelcome to Deland Farmer's Grain\nWelcome to Deland Farmer's Grain Welcome to Deland Farmer's Grain Welcome to Deland Farmer's Grain\n217-664-3321\nHARVEST HOURS\nMonday - Saturday: 7:00 AM - 7:00 PM\nSunday 10AM- 6PM\n*Weather dependent*\n*check back often for the latest hours updates*\noffice hours: Mon-FRIDAY 7:00am - 4:00pm\nAbout Us\nThe Office...\nThere is almost always someone to visit with. Come in and have some coffee and popcorn. Share a story or two.\nSingle Location\nOur single location offers great customer service. We put forth our best effort to take care of our customers and to keep them happy.\nUpdated Facility\nWe are constantly changing and growing our facility to accommodate our customers needs. We offer a speedy turn around time at harvest when dumping our customer's grain, so that they can make it back to the field quickly for that next load.\nCash Bids (10 minute Delayed Pricing)\noffice hours: monday-friday 7:00am -4:00pm\nContact Us\nDrop us a line!\nEmail*\nName\nSend\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\nBetter yet, come see us in person!\nWe love our customers, so feel free to visit during normal business hours.\nDeland Farmer's Coop Grain\n217-664-3321\nHours\nRegular Office Hours:\nMonday - Friday 7:00 am - 4:00 pm\nClosed Saturday & Sunday\nRegular Dump Hours:\nMonday - Friday 7:00 am - 4:00 pm\nClosed Saturday & Sunday\nDownload Reports\nClick on a file to download.\nRain Gauge Log - 2021 (pdf) Download\nRain Gauge Log - 2020 (pdf) Download\nUSDA report - 08.12.21 (pdf) Download\nUSDA Report - 06.30.21 (pdf) Download\nUSDA report recap - 03.31.21 (pdf) Download\nUSDA report recap - 02.09.21 (pdf) Download\nLane Elevator - Views From the Top\nCopyright © 2026 Deland Farmer's Coop Grain - All Rights Reserved.\nPowered by",
